  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">사람은 다세포 동물이다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" ></SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">개개의 세포가 주위 환경과 물질교환을 할 수 없으므로 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\">몸을 구성하는 세포 사이를 순환하면서 물질교환을 가능하도록 해주는 체액이 필요하다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" ></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >그 체액이 바로 '혈액'이다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
